  "details": "Recently when I join an instance, I start going somewhere only to seconds later be teleported back to spawn.\nThis seems to be a common occurence for other players, and it seems like it can be observed by other players too (they will notice me coming up to them, only to be teleported back to spawn).\nObserved this behavior on both PC and Android version, so it's not specific.",
